    "detailed_description": "Explore new worlds in Lollypop, the colorful action platformer originally released in 1994 by legendary publisher Rainbow Arts\u00ae! In this adventure, you\u2019ll play as Lolly, a windup doll that mysteriously comes to life with one goal \u2013 to free the world from the evil clutches of Sugarbaby, who is tormenting the land with hordes of quirky enemies. Along Lolly\u2019s journey, you\u2019ll travel through 8 unique worlds \u2013 each one with its own distinct vibe and sound.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFight through obstacles and enemies all attempting to stop Lolly\u2019s crucial rescue mission! Attack enemies and gain treasure by throwing lollipops, and increase health and points by consuming a variety of candies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild up your candy arsenal by collecting extra abilities and power-ups along the way to prepare yourself for boss battles!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this side-scrolling action platformer, energetic gameplay is sweetened with a vibrant yet ominous soundtrack and highly-detailed environments that fill the game\u2019s landscapes.",
